  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Just Share</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JustShare is a coalition of churches and development agencies which seeks to address the widening gap between rich and poor in the global economy. JustShare encourages dialogue with banks and other institutions in the City of London in order to achieve positive change. It holds regular debates, training seminars and other events to promote justice for the poorest in the world and a just share of the world&apos;s resources for all.</narrative>
  </description>
